{"seq":78,"slug":"api-design-patterns","title":"API 设计模式","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns","rating":{"composite":4.16,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# API 设计模式\n\n当前端应用从单体迈向微服务、从浏览器扩展到移动端与 AI Agent，API 已不再是\"后端给前端的数据出口\"——它是系统间协作的契约语言。一条精心设计的 API 能让十个团队并行开发而彼此无感；一条糟糕的 API 则让每次迭代都变成跨团队联调地狱。\n\n本 hub 聚焦 **API 的设计决策与模式**：如何选择范式（REST / GraphQL / gRPC / tRPC）、如何用 OpenAPI 3.1 或 Protocol Buffers 固化契约、如何处理版本演进与兼容性、如何为开发者（包括 AI Agent）提供可发现、可预测的接口体验。\n\n## 与兄弟 hub 的分工\n\n- **前端数据获取**（`42_frontend-data-fetching`）侧重客户端如何消费 API——缓存策略、请求生命周期、乐观更新。本 hub 侧重 API 本身的设计与治理。\n- **前端安全**（`39_frontend-security-engineering`）覆盖认证令牌、CSRF、CORS 等安全机制。本 hub 仅在\"认证设计模式\"层面触及，安全细节指向该 hub。\n- **微前端**（`14_micro-frontends`）讨论前端拆分与集成。当微前端需要 BFF 层时，其 API 设计原则来自本 hub。\n\n## 推荐学习路径\n\n1. **基础篇**（`1_foundations`）：理解四大范式的定位、OpenAPI 3.1 规范、资源建模基本功。适合所有读者作为起点。\n2. **模式篇**（`2_patterns`）：深入分页/过滤/幂等/HATEOAS 等工程模式，掌握日常 API 设计的关键决策点。\n3. **开发者体验篇**（`3_developer-experience`）：从消费者视角优化 API——错误设计、SDK 生成、AI Agent 可调用性。\n4. **治理篇**（`4_governance`）：规模化场景下的版本策略、契约测试、API 生命周期管理。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- HTTP 协议基础（方法、状态码、头部）\n- JSON 数据格式\n- 至少一门后端或全栈框架的开发经验\n- 了解 TypeScript 类型系统（tRPC 相关章节）\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础：范式与契约","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"paradigm-selection","title":"API 范式选型：REST、GraphQL、gRPC 与 tRPC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/foundations/paradigm-selection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"openapi-contract-first","title":"OpenAPI 3.1 与契约驱动开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/foundations/openapi-contract-first"},{"seq":3,"slug":"resource-modeling","title":"RESTful 资源建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/foundations/resource-modeling"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"patterns","title":"工程模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pagination-filtering","title":"分页、过滤与排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/patterns/pagination-filtering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"idempotency-retry","title":"幂等性与重试设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/patterns/idempotency-retry"},{"seq":3,"slug":"authentication-authorization","title":"认证与授权模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/patterns/authentication-authorization"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"developer-experience","title":"开发者体验","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/developer-experience","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"error-design","title":"错误设计与状态码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/developer-experience/error-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"docs-sdk-generation","title":"文档生成与 SDK 工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/developer-experience/docs-sdk-generation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-agent-apis","title":"AI Agent 可调用的 API 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/developer-experience/ai-agent-apis"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"governance","title":"API 治理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/governance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"versioning-compatibility","title":"API 版本策略与兼容性演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/governance/versioning-compatibility"},{"seq":2,"slug":"contract-testing","title":"契约测试与 CI 自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/governance/contract-testing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lifecycle-management","title":"API 生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/governance/lifecycle-management"}]}]}